    "body": "Thank you for taking the time to review this incident and for understanding its severity.\n\nI first noticed the issue when several applications installed under Program Files could no longer launch. I then discovered that PowerShell was also no longer working normally.\n\nI cannot confirm which application was affected first at the filesystem level, but these were the first problems I noticed after the cleanup.\n\nI agree that destructive commands should be independently validated before execution, especially when they involve recursive deletion.\n\nI have preserved the original execution logs and can provide additional evidence if needed.\n\nThank you again for your attention to this issue.",
